this PR completely break "Serverless-for-Iran" and other serverless-configs.

in "Serverless for Iran" we should use DOH-with-fragment to obtain correct DNS addresses.

but DOH-domains are blocked in DNS, so we should use DOH IPs in Hosts:

```
"dns": {
  "hosts": {
      "cloudflare-dns.com": ["104.16.248.249", "104.16.249.249", "2606:4700::6810:f8f9", "2606:4700::6810:f9f9"]
  },
  "servers": {
      "https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query"
   }
},
"outbound": [
{
  "protocol": "direct",
  "streamSettings": {
    "finalmask": "fragment..."
    "sockopt":{
      "domainStrategy": "ForceIP",
      "happyEyeballs": "..."
    }
  }
}
]
```


also there is no reason for normal users to use DOH in freedom, anyway programs like v2rayN automatically add a DNS-server-with-DOH-domain-with-IP-DNS to prevent this loop.

when you use DOH in v2rayN, it automatically add:

```
{
  "address": "223.5.5.5",
  "domains": ["full:DOH-domain"]
}
```

